1748887232\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On one side of Maya\u2019s new life, experience her day-to-day interactions and social exploits. In Maya\u2019s Sphere, see relationships develop in character-specific hangouts and events, which lead to enticing lewd scenes and much more! See more than 90 hand-drawn CGs, linked to each character\u2019s event, and deepen your relationships for further sexy content.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084620/extras/0bde0109331e883d58a398f27668ad3b.avif?t=1748887232\" width=616 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other side of Maya\u2019s new life, is her duty as a brand-new Gatekeeper. Maya will need to hunt and defeat demons and send them back to hell. Of course, that comes with its own reward: Sexy encounters with otherworldly beings and supernatural entities!  Build your arsenal with cards awarded in the dungeons and from defeating vicious demons, refine them to make them even more powerful and use them in vicious card battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, undoubtedly, the two sides of Maya\u2019s life will collide! Build your relationships to strengthen your cards in battle! Take out demons and advance the story to unlock new and exciting character events! Experience Maya\u2019s sprawling story of duty, friendship and lust!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So, will you take up the mantle of Gatekeeper and save Earth?</i></p>",
